{
  "total_ms": 56710,
  "total_chars": 240,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "跟亲家吃饭，主位的椅子刚拉开，您是先坐，还是先让？",
      "chars": 25,
      "speech_ms": 5550,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 5550,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "两亲家坐到一张桌上，处好了是亲戚，处不好，夹在中间的儿女最难做。",
      "chars": 32,
      "speech_ms": 7720,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 5950,
      "end_ms": 13670,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "座次上没那么多死规矩，就一条：先请年长的亲家落座，按各家的习惯来，别抢，也别推来推去，落座利索，大家都自在。",
      "chars": 54,
      "speech_ms": 12790,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 14070,
      "end_ms": 26860,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "再说说话头，三样少提：一不比——不比谁家孩子挣得多、谁家房子大；",
      "chars": 32,
      "speech_ms": 6710,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 27260,
      "end_ms": 33970,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "二不翻——儿女小两口拌嘴的事，不往饭桌上端；",
      "chars": 22,
      "speech_ms": 4590,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 34370,
      "end_ms": 38960,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "三不打听——人家的家事、钱财安排，那是人家的私事。",
      "chars": 25,
      "speech_ms": 5550,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 39360,
      "end_ms": 44910,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "夸倒是可以多夸：夸对方把孩子教得好，这一句，比送什么都受用。",
      "chars": 30,
      "speech_ms": 6290,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 45310,
      "end_ms": 51600,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "亲家这门亲，近不得远不得，全在分寸二字。",
      "chars": 20,
      "speech_ms": 4310,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 52000,
      "end_ms": 56310,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    }
  ]
}